cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the functions added in this fork, cite this release together
  with the goFlux paper (Rheault et al. 2024) listed under references.
type: software
title: "goFlux (Rheault et al. 2024), fork with additions"
version: 0.5.0.9002
date-released: 2026-10-09
license: GPL-2.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/jgewirtzman/goFlux"
